L["It does not have much health, but it uses every ability from his main phase - including Soul Extinction, which will one-shot you if it lands. Crowd control it and kill it fast; leaving it up makes the whole intermission far harder."] = "Il n'a pas beaucoup de vie, mais il utilise toutes les capacités de sa phase principale - dont Soul Extinction, qui vous tue instantanément si elle touche. Contrôlez-le et tuez-le vite. Le laisser en vie rend tout l'intermède bien plus difficile."
